InterCom's sounds

Every sound in this directory is InterCom's own. None is a recording and none is taken from
another product: apps/desktop/intercom/gen-sounds.py works them out from sine waves, and running
it again writes the same files. They are covered by the licence of this repository
(AGPL-3.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only OR LicenseRef-Element-Commercial, see the LICENSE files in the
repository root).

join, leave               somebody (you or another) coming into a call, and going: two notes
                          a major third apart (C, E), up and down, a third of a second
mute, unmute              your microphone going off, and on
deafen, undeafen          your hearing going off, and on
ringtone                  a call coming in; one round of a loop (2.4 s)
ringback                  a call going out, until it is answered; one round of a loop (3 s)

This directory is where other builds of InterCom (the Android app) take their copies from.
